<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>
  You've been invited to Social Media Automator. Click the link below to set your password and get started:
</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Set your password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>
</p>

<p>This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.</p>

<p>If you weren't expecting this invite, you can ignore this email.</p>
